# OpenTelemetry configuration for the blackboard runners (runner.py / runner_github.py).
# The endpoint is NOT hardcoded in code; set it here (or export it in the environment).
# Set OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT to your OTLP collector, e.g. an OTLP/HTTP endpoint:
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318/v1/traces
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=blackboard
# Tip: OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is the OpenTelemetry standard name; the alias
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLO_ENDPOINT (common typo) is also accepted.
